{"title": "Grit", "pageid": 28371, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Grit", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Grit</b> is a passive feature that grants the wearer a bonus action if they are severely injured.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When the wearer has 50% <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> or less, they have an additional <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Extra_Bonus_Action\"> Condition: Extra Bonus Action </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Bonus_Action_(Condition)\" title=\"Extra Bonus Action (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Extra_Bonus_Action_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Extra_Bonus_Action_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Extra_Bonus_Action_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Extra_Bonus_Action_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Extra_Bonus_Action_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Extra_Bonus_Action_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Extra Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Extra_Bonus_Action_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Extra_Bonus_Action_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/90/Extra_Bonus_Action_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Bonus_Action_(Condition)\" title=\"Extra Bonus Action (Condition)\">Extra Bonus Action</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Grants an additional <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> on this turn.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helmet_of_Grit\" title=\"Helmet of Grit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Helmet_of_Grit_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helmet_of_Grit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Helmet_of_Grit_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Helmet_of_Grit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Helmet_of_Grit_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Helmet_of_Grit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Helmet_of_Grit_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helmet_of_Grit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Helmet_of_Grit_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Helmet_of_Grit\" title=\"Helmet of Grit\">Helmet of Grit</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a> are included in the calculation of total hit points required to activate Grit, including with the below listed bug.\n<ul><li>For example, if the wearer has a hit point maximum of 90, Grit activates once their hit points are reduced to 45 or lower. If they are at 45 hit points and then receive 14 temporary hit points, their total hit points are now 59; Grit then deactivates and only reactivates once their total hit points fall to 45 or below once again.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The additional <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> granted by this helmet stacks with those from <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_sources_of_additional_resources#Bonus_actions\" title=\"List of sources of additional resources\">other sources</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Rather than only replenishing once per turn, Grit activates each time the wearer's total hit points are reduced to 50% or lower. Thus, it is possible for the wearer to gain multiple additional <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">bonus actions</a> in a turn by being healed above and then reduced again to 50% or less <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715002043\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1455/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16773/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6439/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1046709/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.960      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   45.960      1 -total\n 26.56%   12.205      1 Template:Condition\n 19.86%    9.127      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 18.21%    8.367      2 Template:R\n 15.50%    7.123      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 14.18%    6.517      1 Template:Condition_full/format\n 13.97%    6.420      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 10.84%    4.983      1 Template:Item_icon\n 10.70%    4.916      2 Template:Icon_text\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28371-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715002043 and revision id 390604. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}